TEL;type=WORK;type=VOICE;type=pref:617 621 0903
NOTE:_____________________________________________\nFrom: Parker Jr.\, John\nSent: Friday\, March 28\, 2008 10:23 PM\nTo: Pega Cambridge\nSubject: Cafe On Main At 101 Main Street Coming Soon\nImportance: High\n\n\n                 \n                Cafe On Main\n\n\nOur building management company here in Cambridge has indicated that the new restaurant - Cafe on Main will be opening soon! The only hurdle at this point is the final approvals by the City of Cambridge. \n\nItems of interest\n\n\n·       The operating hours for Cafe on Main will be Monday - Friday from 7:30 A.M. - 3:00 P.M.\, serving breakfast\, lunch and featuring Starbucks Coffees. \n\n\n·       A sample menu is attached. \n\n\n·       The cafe will feature different daily specials\, a carvery\, deli\, salad bar\, and grill. \n\n\n·       Wireless internet access for your computing needs is available\n\n\n·       A full catering menu will be available once the cafe opens.\n\n\nAlthough the specific date for the Grand Opening has not been finalized\, it is expected to occur by mid April.  We will keep you posted once we get closer to the long anticipated opening!\n\n<<Sample Cafe on Main Menu.pdf>>\n\nCorporate Services
X-ABShowAs:COMPANY
END:VCARD
